WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:01.760
The east

00:01.840 --> 00:03.400
Had smoke rising early

00:04.120 --> 00:05.360
While the west

00:05.440 --> 00:07.280
Only started cooking at dusk

00:07.360 --> 00:08.920
This shows the supervision troops

00:09.000 --> 00:10.920
Should have returned to the western camp

00:11.000 --> 00:12.360
These past few days

00:12.440 --> 00:14.760
The Wunu only sent Xuan people to die

00:14.840 --> 00:16.840
Mainly to exhaust our arrows

00:17.480 --> 00:19.080
And demoralize our troops

00:19.160 --> 00:20.680
Those supervising

00:20.760 --> 00:22.040
Should not be the main force

00:22.120 --> 00:22.920
So the enemy's main force

00:23.000 --> 00:25.000
Should be in the east

00:25.440 --> 00:27.240
Tonight

00:27.480 --> 00:29.200
Raid the western camp

00:29.280 --> 00:30.240
Brother-in-law

00:30.320 --> 00:32.040
I ask to lead the cavalry out of the city

00:32.120 --> 00:32.680
They are all

00:32.760 --> 00:34.080
Brothers who have followed me

00:34.160 --> 00:35.827
Since I joined the army

00:36.000 --> 00:38.440
Each willing to fight to the death

